            "prompt": ".\\lesson5b_decay_matters.c: In function 'takesArray':\n.\\lesson5b_decay_matters.c:20:19: warning: 'sizeof' on array function parameter 'param' will return size of 'int *' [-Wsizeof-array-argument]\n   20 |             sizeof(param));\n      |                   ^\n.\\lesson5b_decay_matters.c:15:21: note: declared here\n   15 | void takesArray(int param[]) // looks like an array, but it's really int*\n      |                 ~~~~^~~~~~~\n.\\lesson5b_decay_matters.c:22:19: warning: 'sizeof' on array function parameter 'param' will return size of 'int *' [-Wsizeof-array-argument]\n   22 |             sizeof(param) / sizeof(int));   // WRONG answer -- info was lost\n      |                   ^\n.\\lesson5b_decay_matters.c:15:21: note: declared here\n   15 | void takesArray(int param[]) // looks like an array, but it's really int*\n      |            ",
            "tool_use_results": [
